From 3602db6b405cdea4ddfc9a8b5b2789ccad97219b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 13:09:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: delete AiDisk 4-step wizard pages (Phase 1.4)

Remove the wizard launcher www/aidisk.asp and the wizard-only pages under
www/aidisk/: Aidisk-1..4.asp, Aidisk-1_help.asp, ASUS_DDNS_TOS.asp,
initial_account.asp. These are the FTP+asuscomm-DDNS onboarding flow; the
DDNS auto-enable wiring lived entirely in Aidisk-4.asp/aidisk.asp and dies
with them (generic inadyn DDNS subsystem untouched). KEPT in www/aidisk/:
the account/folder/permission Tier-2 pages + pop*/set_*/switch_* dialogs +
shared AiDisk_style.css/aidisk.css that Advanced_AiDisk_samba/ftp/NFS use.
Entry-point repoint + rebrand follows in the next commit.
